      "act": "Trace The Model",
      "lane": "remotion",
      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "narration_text": "Lambert alone returns zero on the back-facing side. Real scenes often contain indirect illumination. This shader uses a constant ambient color as a cheap stand-in for that missing light.",
